          "id": "the-land-of-snow:69n0ex",
          "html": "If the puzzle is too difficult to solve, either teleport out and then come back or log out (this will allow you to begin from the entrance of the room) and start over.",
          "text": "If the puzzle is too difficult to solve, either teleport out and then come back or log out (this will allow you to begin from the entrance of the room) and start over.",
